# r1106cbp (rerun of r1106cbo) single boot: chain + ADD="buzzier_bees-*.jar,blueprint-*.jar", group A (SQ-CBO-24)
## SQ-CBO-24 | chain + buzzier_bees-*.jar,blueprint-*.jar
bootexpect \[creativebrewing\] members: \[vinery, brewinandchewin\]$
bootreject Missing or unsupported mandatory|Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|creativebrewing.*(NoClassDefFoundError|ClassNotFoundException)|Encountered an unexpected exception
shell ! grep -nE "ReferenceError|TypeError|EvaluatorException|is not defined" logs/kubejs/startup.log logs/kubejs/server.log
> cbo all
waitlog \[cbo\] done 30
expect effects leaks 0$
reject \[cbo\] leak 
reject \[cbo\] leak .*echo_
expect mods loaded 1 of 24: buzzier_bees$
> zq potion minecraft:luck minecraft:redstone,minecraft:glowstone_dust
> zq potion minecraft:awkward buzzier_bees:four_leaf_clover
sleep 3
expect redstone -> .*long_luck
expect glowstone_dust -> .*strong_luck
expect four_leaf_clover -> .*luck
